<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 4/7.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 4/7.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Friday set the following exchange rates for July 4/7. The kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>		  July 4/7	 July 3/4</p>
<p>    CZK	 0.4322	  0.43165</p>
<p>    DKK	 2.10058	 2.10123</p>
<p>    FIM	 2.68823	 2.6851 </p>
<p>    GBP	23.60233	23.50433</p>
<p>    HUF	 0.0744	  0.07451</p>
<p>    LTL	 3.49939	 3.5112</p>
<p>    LVL	24.55163	24.53224</p>
<p>    RUR	 0.00242	 0.00243</p>
<p>    SEK	 1.81705	 1.80373</p>
<p>    UAH	 7.54289	 7.57303</p>
<p>    USD	13.9932	 14.0404</p>
<p>    XEU	15.73885	15.7428</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
